config BR2_PACKAGE_FBDOOM
	bool "fbdoom"
	help
	  fbDOOM: the Doom engine (Chocolate Doom based) on the Linux
	  console frame buffer and keyboard, with the shareware
	  doom1.wad (episode 1) from Debian's doom-wad-shareware.

	  Run "doom" from a virtual console: a 320x200 window in the
	  current console mode, or "doom -mode 640x480" for full screen
	  (scaled x2); -scaling N, -pckeys for a USB keyboard alone.
	  Patched for big-endian m68k, the Amiga keyboard and speed on
	  the 68040/68060.

	  https://github.com/maximevince/fbDOOM
